ed; any mistake you make may lead to <strong><i>Perma Death</i></strong>. So, stay curious, but most importantly, stay cautious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What emerges from the sea remains unpredictable, so prepare to face procedurally generated monster squads, thus <strong><i>each run is unique</i></strong>! Slay hordes of monsters before they halt your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, most unfortunately, you will lose all your progress. Yet don't panic at all, all the resources you've collected this run will be automatically used for unlocking <strong><i>new ships</i></strong> from the shipyard. Each time you die, you die with honor. Pick your favorite ship, wield your favorite weapon, and get ready to smash through the sea in this bloodshed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully, you will manage to escape from this <strong><i>Hopeless Sea</i></strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732210/extras/22ea2c7133036377a1ec7bc167c974a3.avif?t=1758542987\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p>","developers":["Potato Cat"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732210/8cd101a838be2822c57e00d3c17f4baa51654905/header.jpg?t=1758542987","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2732210/2037725292/97ac0cf29841e46d30430e1377177a467b1f7dc2/1750174532/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750176038","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2732210/2037725292/97ac0cf29841e46d30430e1377177a467b1f7dc2/1750174532/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750176038","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2732210/2037725292/97ac0cf29841e46